      "package": {
        "maintainer": "Morteza Ansarinia",
        "name": "ui",
        "metadata_modified": "2016-03-31T18:25:59.146594",
        "author": "Morteza Ansarinia",
        "url": "",
        "notes": "User interfaces and respective behaviors ontology, based on early works of great Semantic-UI project. As a consequence, it's more around web-oriented graphical user interfaces (At least for the v1.0.0). It is under active development to cover active projects like Bootstrap and Foundation. It's ultimate goal is to model and reason various kinds of user interfaces of computing devices. The OWL 2 profile is not chosen yet, but it seems to develop towards modeling rather than reasoning.",
